    Bug 1755659 - Fix Mark All Read for newsgroups. r=mkmelin


    For 'Mark'->'All Read' and 'Mark Newsgroup Read', do not mark older messages
    that have not yet been fetched as read. This is still possible via the
    'Download Headers' dialog.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D254949

